data: {"id": "94389a1a39af4bfb-thinking-parallel_evidence-1323", "run_id": "94389a1a39af4bfb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `workload`, namespace: `aiops-case-v02`, UID: `49f4b3a0-c450-44f9-8baf-ce88e4ed74c4` (由 Metrics 数据确认)\n- **当前状态**: `phase: Pending`\n- **容器**: 单一容器 `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n\n---\n\n### 事实与证据\n\n#### 1. 调度失败直接原因（Kubernetes 事件）\n根据 `kubectl describe pod` 的输出，`default-scheduler` 连续报出 `FailedScheduling` 警告：\n- **核心报错**: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory.`\n- **预emption 结果**: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for i", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789111115618, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "94389a1a39af4bfb-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "94389a1a39af4bfb", "seq": 1324, "ts_ms": 1789111124526, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 57.43, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v02", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/94389a1a39af4bfb-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "2bc2d42c451dbd01cf062dc0a8bede171703bc2ca655b1b37db41dce4c310ef9", "bytes": 2419}, "snapshot_sha256": "aa555abeed6607c1b5cb88c00977603427d14d7c461bf21617ba0c6c89601576"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

